54	@v_aid_useful:V{at=~10:2026-09-14;ev=[@e_aid_useful];rq=@q_aid_useful;st=pass;tk=@t_aid;wh=@actor;wy=~411:The sheet was viewed in this session. It shows both treatments at all six sampled scales over light, dark and busy backgrounds, and it surfaced a finding neither reference shows alone: the navy outline loses the figure against dark backgrounds but is what separates it against busy ones. Stated limit: at 1x the two treatments are not reliably distinguishable, so the sheet supports the decision from 3x upward.;xr=@x_aid}
55	@v_study_complete:V{at=~10:2026-09-14;ev=[@e_study_complete];rq=@q_study_complete;st=pass;tk=@t_study;wh=@actor;wy=~313:Every declared completeness check passed when run against the retained study: both reference hashes, the exact 180-pixel difference and its single colour-substitution nature, and the unresolved projection, role, scale and animation questions are all stated. This is a textual check and carries no artistic weight.;xr=@x_study}
